message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ToDrinQ drinking-water decision-support platform (backend)"
authors:
  - family-names: Alexandraki
    given-names: Akrivi
    affiliation: Delft University of Technology
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/akrivial/todrinq-platform"
abstract: >-
  Backend that runs independently developed soft sensors for drinking-water
  treatment behind one validated interface, with data-source adapters,
  NGSI-LD (FIWARE) data exchange, a risk layer and an observation store.
  Developed within the ToDrinQ EU Horizon project (Grant Agreement No. 101082035).
keywords:
  - drinking-water treatment
  - soft sensors
  - decision support
  - FIWARE
  - NGSI-LD
